+---
+layout: post
+title: Microsoft Research gift supports multimodal reasoning research
+date: 2024-09-15 09:00:00-0400
+inline: false
+related_posts: false
+---
+
+Our proposal on evaluation of multimodal foundation models for geometry- and motion-aware reasoning, developed with collaborators at Microsoft Research, was selected to receive an unrestricted gift along with Azure compute credits to support ongoing research in multimodal understanding.
